*###############################################################*

*# SBIMS API*

*# Documents Module - FR-09*

*#*

*# Development Manual Test Suite*

*#*

*# Order of execution:*

*# 1. Health Check*

*# 2. Login as Student*

*# 3. Upload Document*

*# 4. List Internship Documents*

*# 5. Retrieve Document*

*# 6. Login as Internship Coordinator*

*# 7. Approve Document*

*# 8. Attempt Review of Already Reviewed Document*

*# 9. Upload Another Document*

*# 10. Reject Document*

*# 11. Student Re-upload After Rejection*

*# 12. Duplicate Document Test*

*# 13. Student Delete Document*

*# 14. Administrator Upload Authorization Test*

*# 15. HTE Supervisor Access Test*

*# 16. Invalid Upload Tests*

*###############################################################*

*###############################################################*

*# Variables*

*###############################################################*

@apiUrl=http://localhost:8000/api/v1

*###*

*### Replace these values with IDs from the active test database.*

@internshipId=REPLACE_WITH_INTERNSHIP_UUID

@documentId=REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENT_UUID

@secondDocumentId=REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_DOCUMENT_UUID

*###*

*### Path to a real test file.*

*### VSCode REST Client supports @filename for multipart uploads.*

@testFile=./fixtures/sample-document.pdf

*###############################################################*

*# Seed Users*

*###############################################################*

@admin=[adminsbims1@grr.la](mailto:adminsbims1@grr.la)

@coordinator=[coordinatorsbims1@grr.la](mailto:coordinatorsbims1@grr.la)

@faculty=[facultysbims1@grr.la](mailto:facultysbims1@grr.la)

@student=[studentsbims1@grr.la](mailto:studentsbims1@grr.la)

@hte=[htesbims1@grr.la](mailto:htesbims1@grr.la)

*###############################################################*

*# Password*

*###############################################################*

@password=Dev2026!

*###############################################################*

*# Access Tokens*

*###############################################################*

*### These are populated manually after successful login.*

@studentToken=REPLACE_WITH_STUDENT_ACCESS_TOKEN

@coordinatorToken=REPLACE_WITH_COORDINATOR_ACCESS_TOKEN

@adminToken=REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN

@facultyToken=REPLACE_WITH_FACULTY_ACCESS_TOKEN

@hteToken=REPLACE_WITH_HTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

*###############################################################*

*# HEALTH*

*###############################################################*

*### Health Check*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - API is running*

GET {{apiUrl}}/health

*###############################################################*

*# LOGIN - STUDENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Login as Student*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - accessToken returned*

*### - Copy accessToken to @studentToken*

POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login

Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "{{student}}",
"password": "{{password}}"
}

*###############################################################*

*# UPLOAD DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload Student Endorsement*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 201*

*### - success = true*

*### - document record returned*

*### - status = pending*

*### - document_type = endorsement*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

endorsement
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# LIST DOCUMENTS*

*###############################################################*

*### List Documents for Internship*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - data is an array*

*### - uploaded endorsement appears in the list*

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{internshipId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# GET DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Retrieve Document Metadata and Signed URL*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - document metadata returned*

*### - url contains a temporary signed download URL*

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# LOGIN - COORDINATOR*

*###############################################################*

*### Login as Internship Coordinator*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - accessToken returned*

*### - Copy accessToken to @coordinatorToken*

POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login

Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "{{coordinator}}",
"password": "{{password}}"
}

*###############################################################*

*# COORDINATOR LIST*

*###############################################################*

*### Coordinator Lists Internship Documents*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - documents are returned*

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{internshipId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# APPROVE DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Approve Pending Document*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - status = approved*

*### - reviewed_by is populated*

*### - reviewed_at is populated*

*### - rejection_reason = null*

PATCH {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/approve

Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# REVIEW ALREADY APPROVED DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Attempt to Approve Already Approved Document*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 400*

*### - Only pending documents can be reviewed*

PATCH {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/approve

Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# UPLOAD SECOND DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload Agreement Document*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 201*

*### - status = pending*

*### - document_type = agreement*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

agreement
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# REJECT DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Reject Pending Agreement*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - status = rejected*

*### - rejection_reason is populated*

*### - reviewed_by is populated*

*### - reviewed_at is populated*

PATCH {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{secondDocumentId}}/reject

Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"reason": "Document is incomplete. Please upload the signed version."
}

*###############################################################*

*# REJECT WITHOUT REASON*

*###############################################################*

*### Attempt to Reject Without a Reason*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 400*

*### - A rejection reason is required.*

PATCH {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{secondDocumentId}}/reject

Authorization: Bearer {{coordinatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
"reason": ""
}

*###############################################################*

*# RE-UPLOAD REJECTED DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Student Re-uploads Rejected Agreement*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 201*

*### - same document record is reused*

*### - status returns to pending*

*### - reviewed_by is cleared*

*### - reviewed_at is cleared*

*### - rejection_reason is cleared*

*### - document_type remains agreement*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

agreement
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="agreement-revised.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# DUPLICATE DOCUMENT*

*###############################################################*

*### Attempt Duplicate Pending Agreement Upload*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 409*

*### - Existing pending document cannot be uploaded again*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

agreement
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="duplicate.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# STUDENT DELETE*

*###############################################################*

*### Delete Student-Owned Document*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - database metadata removed*

*### - corresponding storage object removed*

DELETE {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# ADMINISTRATOR LOGIN*

*###############################################################*

*### Login as Administrator*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login

Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "{{admin}}",
"password": "{{password}}"
}

*###############################################################*

*# ADMIN UPLOAD AUTHORIZATION*

*###############################################################*

*### Administrator Attempts Document Upload*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 403*

*### - Administrator cannot upload documents*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

consent
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="consent.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# HTE SUPERVISOR LOGIN*

*###############################################################*

*### Login as HTE Supervisor*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login

Content-Type: application/json

{
"email": "{{hte}}",
"password": "{{password}}"
}

*###############################################################*

*# HTE SUPERVISOR ACCESS*

*###############################################################*

*### HTE Supervisor Retrieves Assigned Internship Documents*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - assigned HTE internship documents are returned*

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{internshipId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{hteToken}}

*###############################################################*

*# UNAUTHENTICATED ACCESS*

*###############################################################*

*### List Documents Without Authentication*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 401*

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{internshipId}}

*###############################################################*

*# INVALID DOCUMENT TYPE*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload With Unsupported Document Type*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 400*

*### - Invalid document upload data*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

invalid_type
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# MISSING FILE*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload Without File*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 400*

*### - A document file is required.*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

other
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# INVALID INTERNSHIP*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload Using Non-Existing Internship ID*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 403 or 404 depending on resource authorization path*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

other
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="missing-internship.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/sample-document.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# INVALID FILE TYPE*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload Unsupported MIME Type*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 400*

*### - Unsupported file type*

*### - Use an unsupported file such as .txt for this test.*

*###*

*### NOTE:*

*### Replace the path below with an actual unsupported file.*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

other
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="unsupported.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./fixtures/unsupported.txt
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# EMPTY FILE*

*###############################################################*

*### Upload Empty File*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 400*

*### - Empty files are rejected*

*###*

*### NOTE:*

*### Replace the path below with an empty PDF file.*

POST {{apiUrl}}/documents

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SBIMSBoundary

------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="internship_id"

{{internshipId}}
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="document_type"

other
------SBIMSBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="empty.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/empty.pdf
------SBIMSBoundary--

*###############################################################*

*# FINAL DOCUMENT LIST*

*###############################################################*

*### Verify Final Internship Document State*

*###*

*### Expected:*

*### - HTTP 200*

*### - success = true*

*### - remaining documents are returned*

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{internshipId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

*###############################################################*
*# END FR-09 MANUAL TEST SUITE*
*###############################################################*
